 e. Over the 23-month term\, Core Fellows receive USD 100\,000 (USD 50\,000
  a year) plus a health and wellness stipend\, a private studio and regular
  studio visits from regional\, national and international artists and cura
 tors.\n\nOrganisation: Core Residency Program\, Glassell School of Art\, M
 useum of Fine Arts\, Houston (MFAH)\nLocation: Houston\, Texas\, USA (in-p
 erson residency with private studio). International applicants welcome\; l
 imited J-1 visa support through International Arts & Artists. Houston-base
 d applicants get priority when qualifications are comparable.\nAward: USD 
 100\,000 (USD 50\,000 per year) plus a health and wellness stipend\, priva
 te studio\, and free or discounted Glassell School classes. Application fe
 e USD 12.\nDuration: 23-month residency (2027-29).\n\nMore: https://core.s
 lideroom.com/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral#/l
 ogin/program/91530
URL:https://core.slideroom.com/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_m
 edium=referral#/login/program/91530
LOCATION:Houston\, Texas\, USA (in-person residency with private studio). I
 nternational applicants welcome\; limited J-1 visa support through Interna
 tional Arts & Artists. Houston-based applicants get priority when qualific
 ations are comparable.
END:VEVENT
